{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows打印后台处理可疑删除文件。对应需求：权限提升。官方：Suspicious Print Spooler File Deletion。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.file-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows打印后台处理可疑删除文件","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows打印后台处理可疑删除文件\n\n### 为何重要\n获取更高权限\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2021-34527"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"c4818812-d44f-47be-aaef-4cfb2f9cc799","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 权限提升","来源: 默认","对应需求: 权限提升"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"file where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"deletion\" and\n  file.extension : \"dll\" and file.path : \"?:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\spool\\\\drivers\\\\x64\\\\3\\\\*.dll\" and\n  not process.name : (\"spoolsv.exe\", \"dllhost.exe\", \"explorer.exe\")\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1068","name":"Exploitation for Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1068/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1070","name":"Indicator Removal","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1070/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1070.004","name":"File Deletion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1070/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":314,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
